            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+space"} free loop space
            of their base space is characterized (as consisting of the “
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fusion+bundle"}> fusion bundles
            ”) in:
          %ul
